WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.930
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.820
I'm Kurata Sana, a first year
student at Jinbo Junior High!

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.610
Aoki award-winning author Mama!

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:39.120
My manager Rei-kun!

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:40.580
That bizarre bat Babbit!

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:43.240
Hayama Akito...

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:46.250
Matsui Fuka, my buddy!

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:49.630
But even so...

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:51.840
...I still like Hayama.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.590
Even though he and Fuka
are going out, I still love Hayama.

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:59.930
If I still like Hayama after
writing all these words, I might as well let it be!

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:02.470
I will also learn from you,
Sana-chan.

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:06.230
I mean, I'll learn not to expect
anything in return.

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:11.360
This time everything must go according to
plan, nothing can go wrong.

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:12.860
Start!

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:17.990
The Continuous Flames
Of This Summer

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:27.330
Waiting for the signal...
it's really boring.

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:31.080
Burn! Fire! Burn!

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.380
Burn, burn! Hurry up and burn!

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:37.550
Here and there! All catching fire!

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:39.720
Strong fire quickly burns!

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:41.550
Sparks are everywhere!
Everywhere is sparks!

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:43.220
Wait for the signal!

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:47.430
Signal is his name.
Did you know that?

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:51.350
Right! Right! The signal spoils
the scene every time.

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:54.020
As soon as you space out
the real McCoy will appear.

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:56.730
Once I hear the signal go off,
I can get out this labyrinth.

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:59.240
The fire's burning here too.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:02.370
Still no signal! Still no signal!

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.790
I knew it!
Sana-chan hasn't recovered yet!

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.580
This is bad.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:16.630
I can't stand up.

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:22.470
How come it's like this?

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.980
Sana-chan...

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:41.070
Four, three, two, one. Zero!

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.910
She still hasn't come out!

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:46.870
Is Sana-chan in trouble?!

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:49.200
Don't panic, it won't do any good!

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.870
- Calm down, Sagami-san.
 - Yes!

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:56.040
If she's in trouble she'll contact
us with the wireless.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:59.920
That's right, I think the wireless
is in my pocket!

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:02.010
You guys are too paranoid.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:05.720
Sana-chan, hurry and come out.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:07.640
Press the signal button again.

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:16.190
It hurts.

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:20.150
- What is that? Not good!
- Something's fishy going on here.

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:22.570
It's alright, it's alright.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:24.240
Go slow...

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:26.870
My foot's alright,
it doesn't hurt.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:29.490
Ouch!

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.750
Uh oh...

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:41.960
The front hall is made of inflammable material. The fire and smoke can't get in.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:46.890
The temperature is rising and on
top of that there's smoke.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:52.640
This doesn't look good...

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:57.690
My acting skills
can't help me here.

00:04:58.020 --> 00:04:59.520
The situation is dangerous.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:03.650
It looks like I have to call
Rei-kun on the wireless.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:06.280
I'm not in the mood for jokes!

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:07.740
Where's the wireless?

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:14.870
Sana-chan's here and the wireless
is over there.

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:18.080
It fell out when she was
dancing the mambo.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:21.300
It's too hard for Sana-chan
to walk over here.

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:24.130
And she'll be further from the exit!

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:25.300
Eh?

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:27.680
What's this?

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:28.850
What is it?

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:31.510
It's the unforgettable Burutcha.

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:36.850
Why do I have a Burutcha?

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.520
I haven't used it
since I got to junior high.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:43.110
Rei-kun and Hayama don't
use it anymore either.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:47.990
I'm going out with Fuka now.

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.580
I feel horrible, like I'm dying.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:57.790
Dying?

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:00.710
I'm going out with Fuka now.

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:03.500
If I die here...

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:06.970
I'm going out with Fuka now.

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:10.430
...I'll never have to see
them going out.

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:16.350
What's wrong, Akito-kun?

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:17.640
I think of that Burutcha.

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:21.440
Eh, you mean Sana-chan's Burutcha?

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:23.480
Yeah,
but I don't have mine any more.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:25.650
Akito, here's your ice cream!

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:28.200
Look at this one, Tsuyoshi-kun,
it really looks weird.

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:29.740
Thank you, Aya-chan!

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:34.200
- Is this really edible?
- It tastes really good!

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:41.210
Your ice cream's melting.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:46.170
Oops.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:48.840
Don't play with your food!

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.760
Don't play with your food!
Don't waste it!

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:57.560
- I'm not playing.
- Really?

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.190
Why hasn't she come out yet?

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:09.240
Just stop this, director!

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:10.860
There must have been an accident.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:13.620
Call the firefighters
so they can put out the fire!

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:17.330
Prop manager! How long can
the burning-house prop stand?

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:21.370
It can stand for five more minutes,
thanks to the reinforced hallways.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.540
How much time would we
need to rescue Kurata?

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.040
Two minutes would be fine.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.300
There's no problem, we've trained
with dummies for this...

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.630
Hurry up and save Sana-chan,
you idiot!

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:32.510
Sagami-san!
Give her three more minutes.

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:34.510
Wait three minutes.

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:39.520
Please say yes,
we only need three minutes.

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:45.520
You don't even care
about human life!

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:49.320
I'm willing to gamble my own life
on this movie.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:51.450
You can gamble your own life,

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.610
but don't you dare gamble other
people's lives!

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:58.200
Two minutes left

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:58.200
- Is this really ok?
- We've finished escape preparations!

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:06.170
Goodbye, everyone from Earth...

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:10.970
Sana's going...

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:14.760
Ahh, it hurts!

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:17.300
I...

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:21.480
What... what am I thinking?

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:24.770
Is that the pain or the smoke?

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:29.190
I'm becoming weak,
I... can't go out.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:39.200
Sagami-san, please wait one minute,
just one more minute!

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:43.040
If we stop now,
Sana-chan will regret it!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:45.670
Don't waste all
of Sana-chan's effort!

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.330
Effort?

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:50.380
What good are your efforts
when your life is lost?

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:51.800
Enough!

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:52.840
Sagami-san!

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.760
- Forty seconds left!
- Stop.

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:59.470
Stop filming.
Rebuild the house.

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:01.600
We don't have the budget!

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:02.810
Find a way.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:04.190
It's impossible!

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:09.360
Sana, what are you doing?
Hurry up and come out!

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:12.320
Everyone's waiting for you!
I'm waiting too!

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:14.990
Hurry up and come out,
everyone is waiting! I...

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:23.540
I'm not as strong as
everyone says.

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:41.760
Everyone thinks I must be strong
to do my best, but I'm not that strong.

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:46.480
So I have to live and work hard
to make up for it.

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:13.920
Sana-chan...

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.260
Sana-chan!

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:16.720
- Wait!
- Why?

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:18.510
Sana-chan is acting.

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:20.180
Director!

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:22.470
Camera! Rolling!

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:26.980
Mako-san!

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:31.480
Mako-san! Why?

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:34.320
Big brother?

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:38.820
Those two are inside,

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.740
already engulfed by the flames.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:46.660
How...?
Unless... you set the fire?

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:55.670
I took them because I love them.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.090
And me?

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:07.350
I'm not taking you
because I love you.

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:12.610
So live.

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:35.290
Cut, OK!

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:36.960
OK?

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:37.880
OK? OK?

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:40.220
- Tell the firefighters to hurry up!
- This way!

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:41.880
- Sana-chan!
- Naozumi!

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.550
Sana-chan!

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.430
Ahh! Naozumi!

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:49.640
- I'm alright.
- I found a wireless! I'm rich!

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:52.100
Hey! That's Sana-chan's!

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.020
Um... Naozumi-kun...

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:57.400
Did I say my lines alright?

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:58.900
It was fine, don't worry.

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:00.150
Thank goodness...

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:01.740
Sana-chan, please be okay!

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.660
Hurry up and put out the fire!

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:10.040
What is ukiuki?

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:12.040
{parte b}

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:15.330
The answer is iku! (Go! Go!)

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:19.550
Hurry up, doctor!

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:21.380
Naozumi, please be okay!

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:24.840
I'm fine. If I sing the song
the burn will get better.

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:32.020
Sana-chan, it's great that you're
alright I was really worried!

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.190
It could've been easy.

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:39.650
But after dancing the mambo, my leg made a strange noise and gave out under me.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:42.070
Did you let start hurting?
Is it alright?

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:47.070
It's alright, if I sing this song
then it won't hurt anymore.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:49.620
Don't sing, it sounds horrible.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.840
Babbit's here
trying to put out the fire.

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:04.380
Thank you.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.850
Sana-chan! Good job!

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:14.770
Great!

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:24.280
Just admit it.

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:31.160
You're blocking the words.
I can't see!

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:33.830
Cheers!

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:38.290
Back in Tokyo we've still
got some scenes to shoot on the set.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:40.420
Anyway
the location shoot is finished.

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:42.210
Congrats!

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:45.590
- Sana-chan, is your leg better?
- Is it ok?

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:48.890
Yeah. You got burned too...
is your back alright?

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:51.470
- Are you alright?
- It's fine! But...

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:53.100
Sorry, doesn't hurt?

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:56.600
Babbit is soft! See?

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:58.730
Naozumi-kun looks
like he's in pain...

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:00.110
Sana-chan, Naozumi.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:01.650
You two did a good job.

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:05.570
Is this a joke?
The director is a phony.

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:08.530
Sagami-san, quiet down,
the director will hear!

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:09.660
Putting you in danger was my fault.
I'm sorry.

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:13.580
It was my fault. If I didn't dance the mambo my leg wouldn't have ached up.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:15.330
I hate this director.

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:20.830
I promise I'll make it into a nice movie.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:21.710
Ok.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:24.800
Of course! With Sana-chan in it,
how could it be bad?!

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.010
Sana-chan.

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:29.800
Those girls say that
they really want to apologize.

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.430
What'll you do?

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:35.140
There's no other way,
I'll go let them apologize.

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:39.770
Hi! I heard you came to apologize.

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:41.270
Um...

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:42.480
Yes?

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:45.860
Even though
we still don't like you...

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.990
...because of your great work...

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:51.870
sorry to do such a mean thing.

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:55.740
Everyone
thinks this is an apology.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:57.250
Makes me mad.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:58.960
Hey...

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:02.130
All you guys like Naozumi-kun,
right?

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:06.090
You like him... right?

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:13.220
Umm... I... already...

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:22.400
have somebody I like.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.730
Heh, heh... To say this out
is embarrassing.

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:28.190
I just realized it recently.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:31.910
But that bum is going out
with my friend.

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:40.460
Everybody has something
that can't come true,

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:43.920
but they still do their best.

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:48.300
You're not the only ones that hurt.

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:55.050
So I can understand how you feel.

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:56.600
Sorry...

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:59.770
That's alright. Bye!

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:01.440
- The movie...
- Hm...

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:03.730
After it's finished,
we'll go watch it.

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:06.570
We're not watching you,
we're watching Naozumi-kun.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.690
Bye! Bye!

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:15.990
Rei-kun, is there any food left?
- There is.

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:20.700
Those girls will become Sana-chan's
fans in the future.

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:24.830
Alright! I'm gonna eat now.
I'm gonna eat now.

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:25.630
Sana-chan!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:27.210
Ah! Naozumi-kun.

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:30.710
After all those things...
You've worked hard.

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:32.470
Yeah, we worked hard!

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:35.970
After we get back to Tokyo,
I hope I'll see you again.

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:39.260
Hurry up and start packing!

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:47.270
Let's go home, Sana-chan.

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:50.480
Oh, right! Bye, Mountain!

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:52.400
Bye!

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:56.950
This is an anime.
Don't be surprised.

00:16:56.950 --> 00:17:01.790
- Sana-chan is back home.
- Something to be remembered.

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:10.710
Everybody has summer vacation.

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:18.680
Everybody is happily playing.

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:25.730
Where's Sana-chan?

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:27.480
In the hospital.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:30.820
The doctor in the mountain

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:34.570
didn't find
about the broken bones.

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:40.280
This time the whole person is soft
and relaxed. I'm sorry.

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:45.750
Stay here and be good.

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:49.710
Can't do anything
about summer vacation.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:55.420
After saying it, press the button.

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:57.470
In the hospital...

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:59.850
So bored she's
talking with that toy...

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:03.140
I just got home and now I have to
live in the hospital, too bad.

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:05.230
I feel so lazy...

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:07.390
It's hot...

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:08.900
Let's get a picture.

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:13.230
This week's Sana-chan!

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:15.360
Why can't we use this one?

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:17.320
Because this one's better.

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:19.570
It's only temporary.

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:25.250
Sagami will come
after he washes the apples.

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.080
Who gave you these weird flowers?

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:32.420
When did that get there?

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:34.590
- Hello, Sensei!
- Onda!

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:38.220
How can you come into
a sick girl's room!

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:42.180
- Please give me the manuscript!
- No way!

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:45.180
Apples, apples, oo!
Ah, apples, apples, oo...

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:47.730
You can't catch me!

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:50.060
I can't believe you drove
that in here!

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.270
Onda, please be quiet in
the hospital.

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:53.520
Yeah, sorry...

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:56.860
Sensei, the manuscript...

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:59.360
This is very embarrassing...

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:02.160
- Is that so?
- Sensei, you didn't close the door.

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:03.530
Sagami! I'm sorry...

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:05.240
No problem...

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:06.660
I'm bored.

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:08.080
Sana-chan.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:09.410
Yeah...?

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:11.210
Want an apple?

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:16.170
There's two kinds of fruit. Let's see...

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:20.180
What's this soft and mushy thing?

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:25.140
Nope, it's not a pear.
(Same sound)

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:28.390
Visiting hours are over. Go home.

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:45.530
Summer, huh?

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:47.120
Last summer...

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:52.000
Many strange things happened...

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:56.420
But, Hayama was there.

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:05.140
Concentrate and write!

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:07.430
Geez.

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:09.430
Everyone is finishing homework.

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:13.020
All are here 'cause you didn't finish your homework!

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:14.560
How can you act like this?!

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:16.730
Is Sana-chan still on location?

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:19.650
If she came back,
she would call us, right?

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:22.780
I wonder how Sana-chan is doing...

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:26.410
Sana-chan is out of the Hospital.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:29.240
Wow! It's great!

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:31.290
It's just like the old set!

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:33.370
Sana-chan,
be careful with your leg.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:35.330
It's okay this time.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:37.170
- Sana-chan!
- Naozumi-kun!

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:38.710
Long time no see.

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:40.090
Thank for visiting me.

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:43.340
Sana-chan, Naozumi-kun,
it's time to rehearse scene 90.

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:46.550
Sana-chan, have you told anyone
about you coming back?

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:51.310
No, I haven't told anyone.

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:57.610
I don't think anyone knows
that I came back.

00:20:58.480 --> 00:20:59.860
I see...

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:02.740
Please wait on stand-by the door.

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:03.990
Okay.

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.830
- Do your best.
- You too.

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:15.620
When the movie was finished,
it was September.

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:21.550
I had the text all memorized, but
Sana-chan read everything before I started!

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:24.590
Today I have to go to school...

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:28.760
Feeling down... as usual.

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:32.680
Can I still pretend it's business
as usual with my friends?

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:36.100
I'm nervous!

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:38.560
Sana-chan!
You're going to be late!

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:46.240
Can't I just avoid them?

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:50.080
